            <div class="cs-story">
              <p>The Dettyfusion campaign for Access Bank was one of the most intense executions I have been part of. Eight weeks. A lifestyle and mobility app. The entire Detty December cultural moment as the backdrop.</p>
              <p>Timing is a media strategy decision. We mapped the cultural calendar: the concerts, the travel surge, the spending behaviour, and built the media schedule around it. Retention starts at acquisition: 706,000 users onboarded means nothing if they churn in January.</p>
              <p>385,000 users were still active post-launch. That is the number that actually matters.</p>
              <cite>Okugboye Olayinka D., Growth &amp; Strategy Lead</cite>
            </div>
